# battle-aftermath: the parley-combat fight to its end (answer N to Continue Battle), then the aftermath: the treasure and
# experience screens (ovl05), the treasure menus and money (ovl21), the inventory menus (ovl19) reached from them.
# Found with the coverage-guided explorer (tools/c/explore_climb.py), pruned to the keys that matter (explore_prune.py).
# The prefix is parley-combat's. Keys after the fight are `press` with a wait of 30 ticks: the treasure screen animates, and a longer wait stalls the oracle at a blocking prompt.
clock 12:00:16.58
wheel
wait 20
key L
wait 20
key A
wait 300
key E
wait 100
press R                  # camp: Rest
wait 60
press H                  # rest time: Hours
wait 20
press I                  # Inc, eight times
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press R                  # start resting; a monster appears
wait 900
shot encounter
key A
wait 200
key P
wait 200
shot attitudes
key N
wait 400
shot parley
key ENTER
wait 300
shot fight-start
key Q
wait 150
key Q
wait 150
